      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Four Points covers just half a square mile, all land, with no lakes or rivers inside its borders.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Points%2C_Texas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community first appeared in the late 1800s as an offshoot of Botines, roughly five miles north of Laredo.",
